      "record": {
        "knowledge_point": {
          "db_id": 17592186124456,
          "id": "84245283-3cf9-5889-8c42-896a0c8af291",
          "title": "Finding the Points on a Curve at which the Tangent Vector is Perpendicular to a Given Vector"
        },
        "question": {
          ":question/id": "93a64445-b0a7-5df6-a495-a6dbb4fdcb30",
          ":question/difficulty": ":question.difficulty/easy",
          ":question/problem": "At which point on the curve $- 2 x^{2} - 4 x + y - 2=3$ is a tangent vector perpendicular to $\\mathbf v=\\langle -8,1\\rangle$?\n\nUse $F(x,y)=- 2 x^{2} - 4 x + y - 2$ and $\\mathbf t=\\langle F_y,-F_x\\rangle$. Perpendicular vectors have dot product zero.",
          ":question/worked-solution": "Set $F(x,y)=- 2 x^{2} - 4 x + y - 2$, so the curve is $F(x,y)=3$. A tangent vector is $\\mathbf t=\\langle F_y,-F_x\\rangle$.\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\nF_x&=- 4 x - 4\\\\\nF_y&=1\\\\\n\\mathbf t(x,y)&=\\langle 1,4 x + 4\\rangle\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nPerpendicularity requires\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathbf t\\cdot \\langle -8,1\\rangle&=0\\\\\n4 x - 4&=0\\\\\n4 (x - 1)&=0\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe condition gives $x=1$. Substitution into the original curve gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\ny - 8&=3\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nHence $y=11$. Recovering the other coordinate gives $(1,11)$.\n\nThus the qualifying point is $(1,11)$. All listed points lie on the curve. The following nonzero tangent vectors check every choice:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathbf t(-3,11)&=\\langle 1,-8\\rangle,\\qquad \\mathbf t\\cdot \\langle -8,1\\rangle=-16\\\\\n\\mathbf t(-2,5)&=\\langle 1,-4\\rangle,\\qquad \\mathbf t\\cdot \\langle -8,1\\rangle=-12\\\\\n\\mathbf t(-1,3)&=\\langle 1,0\\rangle,\\qquad \\mathbf t\\cdot \\langle -8,1\\rangle=-8\\\\\n\\mathbf t(0,5)&=\\langle 1,4\\rangle,\\qquad \\mathbf t\\cdot \\langle -8,1\\rangle=-4\\\\\n\\mathbf t(1,11)&=\\langle 1,8\\rangle,\\qquad \\mathbf t\\cdot \\langle -8,1\\rangle=0\n\\end{aligned}\n$$",
          ":question/answer-fields": [
            {
              ":answer-field/id": "3e754649-7e44-5012-a991-194dee33406a",
              ":answer-field/key": "selection",
